sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant UI as Student Web/App
    participant API as Next.js API / Server Actions
    participant BookingEngine as Booking Logic
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant RZP as Razorpay

    Student->>UI: Select Plan & Seat
    UI->>API: Initialize Booking (POST /api/...)
    API->>BookingEngine: Validate Availability & Rules
    BookingEngine->>DB: Create BookingIntent (HOLDING)
    BookingEngine->>DB: Create ResourceLease (Temp Lock)
    API->>RZP: Create Razorpay Order
    RZP-->>API: order_id
    API-->>UI: Return order_id
    
    Student->>UI: Pay via Razorpay Checkout
    UI->>RZP: Complete Payment
    RZP-->>Student: Success
    
    note over API,RZP: Asynchronous Webhook
    RZP->>API: Webhook POST /api/webhooks/razorpay (payment.captured)
    API->>DB: Validate signature & fetch intent
    API->>DB: Update BookingIntent (CONFIRMED)
    API->>DB: Create permanent Booking record
